description:
Write `#[derive(Debug, Clone, Copy, PartialEq, Eq, PartialOrd, Ord)] struct Money(i64)` holding pence, with:

- `Add`, `Sub`, `Neg` and `AddAssign` between `Money` values, and `Mul<i64>` (money times a count);
- `Display` as `£12.34`, `£0.05` or `-£1.50`;
- `FromStr` reading `12.34`, `12`, `-1.5` or `0.05` (an optional `-`, whole pounds, an optional `.` with one or two digits). Anything else is an `Err(String)`.

starter.solution.rs:
